# Preferred H10--H14 closure from action symmetries and positive projections

The five-sector action symmetries construct and count the actual zero modes.
A positive bounded resolution of the identity by the same five sectors supplies
the Pythagorean norm decomposition.  The projected principal Hessian and the
canonical H11 physical bound then produce the actual-kernel gap and the complete
H12 spectral package.
-/

